# Polyray Manual

Polyray is a raytracing program for producing scenes of 3D shapes and surfaces.

This manual documents the modified Polyray 1.9.x branch maintained by Clyde Meli, based on the original Polyray by Alexander R. Enzmann.

## Start here

- [Introduction](1_introduction.md)

## About this manual

This documentation modernises the original fixed-width Polyray manual while preserving historical information where useful.